# Auto-review routing. First match from the bottom wins, so specific paths
# go last. Replace @longdrache with team slugs (e.g. @org/backend-team)
# once teams exist. Every PR touching these paths requires the owner's
# review when the ruleset enforces it (see rulesets/protect-main.json).

# Backend API — auth/premium/JWT are security-sensitive zones
/be/src/auth/        @longdrache
/be/src/premium/     @longdrache
/be/src/admin/       @longdrache
/be/prisma/          @longdrache
/be/test/            @longdrache
/be/scripts/        @longdrache

# Frontends
/FE/                 @longdrache
/admin/              @longdrache

# Pipeline & infra — changing CI changes how code ships; always second pair
# of eyes. e2e specs encode release-blocking behavior.
/.github/            @longdrache
/e2e/                @longdrache
/docker-compose*     @longdrache
/be/docker-compose* @longdrache

# Product docs
*.md                 @longdrache
